==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration features the Matron Trim of {{p|Furfrou}}.
*{{a|Fur Coat}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Furfrou}} can have.
*'''Hammer In''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Larvitar|87}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

